    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "The cyan/red-on-charcoal palette, crisp borders, consistent mono labels, and strong ALLOW/BLOCK contrast create a cohesive, polished defense-console identity. Desktop hierarchy is confident and balanced. Tablet remains orderly, but the stacked card becomes very long. Mobile is visibly over-compressed: numerous labels, annotations, evidence lines, and footer text render extremely small; the results region is dense and scanning hierarchy weakens. The mobile header also shows only a narrow nav fragment, while measured contrast checks remain incomplete for 13 header nodes.",
